    "message": "Seed a replay's history cache with the EventLog it starts from\n\nEach replayed branch converted its whole EventLog for the first minute's\nstate hash. iter_worlds can now seed a history cache with the EventLog of\nthe Checkpoint the replay restores (as advance and fork do, #231), so the\nfirst minute converts only what the replayed ticks added.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
